    "minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统 *:</strong> Windows Vista SP2 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Haswell 2 cores / 4 threads @ 2.5Ghz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Intel HD 4600 or equivalent - This includes most GPUs scoring greater than 950 points in the 3DMark Fire Strike benchmark<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 20 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>支持 VR:</strong> SteamVR. Keyboard or gamepad required</li></ul>",
